## Interface: 120105, 16001
## Title: QuestBook
## Notes: A readable quest log that replaces Blizzard's, plus a map overlay (minimap or world map beside your character), a text strip and drawers for the menu, bags and addons. /qb or bind a key.
## Author: Cesar & Nibble
## Version: 0.29.1
## OptionalDeps: EllesmereUI, EllesmereUIQuestTracker
## SavedVariables: QuestBookDB
